{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4vNTBCwBgTkLjuS5tY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, ancient oak, grain weathered by countless seasons.*\n\n*A iron keyhole glints at my center, dark and waiting.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*Tumblers turn — one, two, three — each falling into place with a satisfying, resonant*\n\n**CLUNK**\n\n*My hinges groan. Light spills through the widening crack — warm, golden, carrying the scent of old books and something sweeter underneath, like memory itself.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor you remember but have never walked. The floorboards know your weight already.*\n\n*Enter.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":150,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}